WEBVTT

00:00:00.587 --> 00:00:01.435
<v><b>A:</b></v> What is <b>it</b>?

00:00:03.415 --> 00:00:04.373
<v><b>B:</b></v> It’s <b>a book.</b>

00:00:06.377 --> 00:00:07.328
It’s <b>a key.</b>

00:00:09.317 --> 00:00:10.439
It’s <b>an umbrella.</b>

00:00:12.457 --> 00:00:13.868
It’s <b>an ID card.</b>